7. Canonical Data Entity Model

Every governed Atlas data entity SHALL contain the following common elements.

Element	Description
Entity ID	Globally unique identifier
Entity Type	Canonical classification
Owner	Responsible authority
Version	Version identifier
Context	Engineering context
Metadata	Descriptive information
Provenance	Origin information
Traceability	Linked entities
Security Classification	Access classification
Lifecycle State	Current maturity
Created Timestamp	Creation time
Modified Timestamp	Latest modification

All canonical entities inherit this base model.

8. Data Relationships

Atlas recognizes the following canonical relationships.

